WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.199 --> 00:00:07.629
. Is Donald Trump actually instituting the
martial law that we were warned Barack Obama

00:00:07.629 --> 00:00:12.040
was actually going to institute if you were
paying attention to politics during the Barack

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:14.040
Obama administration?

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:19.010
You might remember the unhinged, belligerent
fear mongering from the right that Barack

00:00:19.010 --> 00:00:22.390
Obama plans to enact martial law in the United
States.

00:00:22.390 --> 00:00:26.520
Some versions of the conspiracy said that
it was part of a plan to enslave people in

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:28.070
FEMA camps.

00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:31.270
Sometimes RFID chips were involved, sometimes
not up.

00:00:31.270 --> 00:00:35.460
And all of this was part of Obama's bigger
plan to suspend the 2012 election, which he

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:36.460
didn't do.

00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:41.090
And then it was actually about suspending
the 2016 election and remaining in power indefinitely

00:00:41.090 --> 00:00:45.840
while bringing authoritarian, militaristic
terror to the streets of America against the

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:49.760
wishes of state and local authorities and
elected officials.

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:54.370
And if you were paying attention, you knew
that Barack Obama had no interest in doing

00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:55.690
any such thing.

00:00:55.690 --> 00:00:59.989
There was no chance whatsoever that that was
what Barack Obama was going to do.

00:00:59.989 --> 00:01:01.970
But that gets us to today.

00:01:01.970 --> 00:01:08.009
And we actually have to have a discussion
today about whether Donald Trump is indeed

00:01:08.009 --> 00:01:14.530
instituting martial law by the forceful deployment
of paramilitaries to cities around the country,

00:01:14.530 --> 00:01:19.930
where if you look at Portland, for example,
those troops have teargassed the mayor of

00:01:19.930 --> 00:01:20.930
Portland.

00:01:20.930 --> 00:01:24.109
More on that later attacked reporters and
journalists.

00:01:24.109 --> 00:01:27.539
And so the first step is, what is martial
law?

00:01:27.539 --> 00:01:31.100
If we don't know what it is, it's hard to
determine whether we are seeing it.

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:39.049
While martial law is when normal civil functions
and civil law are replaced by military control.

00:01:39.049 --> 00:01:44.520
Sometimes martial law can be declared during
a real or fabricated emergency situation as

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:51.810
a lead up to or after a coup in the context
of a natural disaster or states of emergency.

00:01:51.810 --> 00:01:54.240
And there's some other situations as well.

00:01:54.240 --> 00:01:58.159
And often martial law includes any or all
of the following.

00:01:58.159 --> 00:02:04.259
The military in the streets working as local
law enforcement, curfews, the suspension of

00:02:04.259 --> 00:02:11.819
habeas corpus and normal due process, military
law and justice being applied to civilians.

00:02:11.819 --> 00:02:16.460
So do we have literal martial law today in
the United States?

00:02:16.460 --> 00:02:17.790
No, we don't.

00:02:17.790 --> 00:02:20.540
Up is what Donald Trump has done so far.

00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:22.010
Literal fascism.

00:02:22.010 --> 00:02:23.010
It's not.

00:02:23.010 --> 00:02:29.500
But we are seeing what the early phases of
potentially future widespread martial law

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:31.970
could look like if slowly deployed.

00:02:31.970 --> 00:02:36.790
Now, if you deny this basic fact, you're denying
reality right now.

00:02:36.790 --> 00:02:38.280
It's not all happening at once.

00:02:38.280 --> 00:02:42.689
It's not completely obvious unless you look
step by step.

00:02:42.689 --> 00:02:44.689
But that's what makes it harder to see.

00:02:44.689 --> 00:02:48.640
And in fact, authoritarian dictators understand
this.

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:51.780
And they often deploy martial law in baby
steps.

00:02:51.780 --> 00:02:57.890
Now, again, to be completely clear, I am not
saying we will soon have a fully authoritarian

00:02:57.890 --> 00:03:01.220
police state martial law situation in the
United States.

00:03:01.220 --> 00:03:04.910
And part of the reason we may not is Trump
will run out of time.

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:10.150
He will either win reelection and no longer
need these authoritarian escalations to try

00:03:10.150 --> 00:03:14.359
to help himself get reelected or he will lose.

00:03:14.359 --> 00:03:18.540
And as far as I'm concerned, he will leave
office and thus it will stop the escalation

00:03:18.540 --> 00:03:19.629
as well.

00:03:19.629 --> 00:03:21.519
But think through the steps.

00:03:21.519 --> 00:03:27.390
Donald Trump is deploying federal troops,
armed power paramilitaries to cities and towns.

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:30.090
These troops aren't part of the normal military
branches.

00:03:30.090 --> 00:03:32.709
They're part of homeland security.

00:03:32.709 --> 00:03:38.150
But they really are a military that is functioning
at the pleasure of the president as local

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:43.640
law enforcement, overriding local law enforcement,
camouflaged with body armor, carrying heavy

00:03:43.640 --> 00:03:46.499
weapons, throwing people into unmarked vans.

00:03:46.499 --> 00:03:50.659
Even local politicians and reporters are getting
hit now.

00:03:50.659 --> 00:03:55.359
Many of them are being released after being
thrown into a van and brought to who knows

00:03:55.359 --> 00:03:56.389
where.

00:03:56.389 --> 00:04:01.400
And it's true that when you look at some of
the worst police states and martial law situations

00:04:01.400 --> 00:04:06.599
of the last 40, 50 years around the world,
many of them don't release people without

00:04:06.599 --> 00:04:09.640
charges if it turns out they don't want to
charge you.

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:13.080
Sometimes they bring you into a dark room
and they kill you and you never hear from

00:04:13.080 --> 00:04:14.080
them again.

00:04:14.080 --> 00:04:15.080
You never hear fee.

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:16.080
You are never heard from again.

00:04:16.080 --> 00:04:21.190
And this happened to friends of my parents
in the 1970s during the military dictatorship

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:22.190
in Argentina.

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:28.170
It's not where we are and we're not actually
close to that right now, but at least colloquially,

00:04:28.170 --> 00:04:34.150
they are replacing civil law with troops,
federal troops, quite literally, if mayors

00:04:34.150 --> 00:04:36.380
and governors don't want them there.

00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:40.180
They are in conflict with local law enforcement.

00:04:40.180 --> 00:04:49.070
They are enforcing a sort of federal military
